- Delay
- Maximum waiting age
- Downstream spillback
- Phase switching cost
- Pedestrian delay
- Emergency delay
- Fairness

Use configurable objective weights.

Enforce:

- Minimum green
- Maximum green
- Yellow clearance
- All-red clearance
- Maximum red where feasible
- Pedestrian walk and clearance
- Conflicting movement restrictions
- Legal phase sequences
- Downstream storage constraints
- Emergency preemption requirements

Explain whether the optimization is convex, mixed-integer, or uses legal candidate enumeration.

